  "post_content": "<div>(7 fotos) La parella formada per Javi Ortells d&#39;Onda i el local David Fausto, de blau, han pogut guanyar per 31-29 a la parella d&#39;Onda, pare i fill, Diego L&oacute;pez i Pedro L&oacute;pez, vestits de roig, en la final del I torneig de front&oacute; a m&agrave; de la XXXII setmana del Centre Cultural Suera.</div>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG-20160806-WA0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 356px;\" /></div>\n<div>Amb bona assist&egrave;ncia de p&uacute;blic, el trofeus els han lliurat l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garc&iacute;a i la reina de les festes de 2015, Alba Lengua Garcia. Han jugat&nbsp;un total de sis parelles d&#39;Onda, Suera, Vila-real i Albuixec.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Per a les properes festes d&#39;octubre ja pensen en repetir la jornada de pilota en la modalitat de galotxa.</div>\n<div>\n <div>&nbsp;</div>\n <div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0001.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0002.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0005.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0006.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigfrontoamasetmanacentreculturalsuera/img-20160806-wa0010.jpg\" alt=\"img-20160806-wa0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
